Hakushi bundles third-party open-source components whose own licenses continue
to apply. A full, generated inventory is in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md. The items
below carry attribution or redistribution obligations that the crate/package
metadata alone does not surface:

- libgit2 (desktop builds only) — GPL-2.0 WITH a linking exception.
  Vendored via libgit2-sys. The linking exception permits distributing libgit2
  linked into a differently-licensed work (here, MIT), provided this notice is
  preserved. Copyright (c) the libgit2 contributors.
  https://github.com/libgit2/libgit2/blob/main/COPYING

- OpenSSL (desktop builds only) — Apache License 2.0 (OpenSSL 3.x).
  Vendored via openssl-src for HTTPS transport. Copyright (c) the OpenSSL
  Project Authors. https://www.openssl.org

- SQLite — Public Domain. Compiled from source (bundled) for the link index.
  https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html

- MPL-2.0 components — Servo CSS-parsing crates (Rust) and the mdast2docx Docx
  toolchain (npm). Used unmodified; source is published on crates.io / npm.

Mobile builds (iOS / Android) use the pure-Rust `gix` and `rustls` stacks and
include neither libgit2 nor OpenSSL.
